{'symbol': 'UNM', 'date': '2021-05-05 16:15:00', 'title': 'UNUM GROUP REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'CHATTANOOGA, TENN., MAY 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0UNUM GROUP (NYSE: UNM) TODAY REPORTED NET INCOME OF $153.0 MILLION ($0.75 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE) FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021, COMPARED TO NET INCOME OF $161.0 MILLION ($0.79 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE) FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2020.'}